= Coordinate with the Jedi Council

The Jedi Council is deciding what to do about the Chancellor. The Senate must be part of that decision.

- @do: Coordinate with the Jedi Council.
- @easy_discard

@do
on-arrival: jedi_suspicion += 1.5; jedi_relation += 4; senate_jedi_pact = 1

Master Windu agrees: if the Jedi move against the Chancellor, a Senate delegation will stand with them and the Supreme Court will be told at once.
